   "design": "Cleaners clock in and out with a QR or NFC tag at the site entrance in the planning system's app ({HCM}); no location tracking is used. Hours land in the system, which lists only deviations from the roster for the supervisor to correct. After the supervisor approves the period, hours flow to {PAYROLL}, and a dashboard shows hours against each site's budget. Sick reports go into a short form with dates only, never the cause.",
   "previous_blocker": "Paper time sheets were typed into spreadsheets and mailed to payroll.",
   "enabler_now": "Cleaning operations suites offer clock-in by QR or NFC linked to payroll.",
   "still_hard": "Forgotten clock-ins still need fixing; clock data can be used to watch staff.",
   "human_edge": "Knowing that a cleaner stayed late to help a colleague and making sure it is paid.",
   "ambition": {
    "kind": "none",
    "what": ""
   },
   "altitude": "The supervisor approves deviations instead of typing hours.",
   "reach": [
    {
     "role": "payroll administrator",
     "task": "Process cleaners' hours",
     "learn": "Whether payroll corrections fall."
    }
   ],
   "build_days": {
    "coding": "0-1",
    "integration": "3-6",
    "testing_rollout": "2-4",
    "consent_and_access": "5-15"
   },
   "run_cost": "low",
   "evidence": [
    {
     "claim": "FacilityApps offers clock-in by GPS, QR or NFC linked to payroll.",
     "grade": "E2",
     "source": "[S1]",
     "kind": "capability"
    },
    {
     "claim": "The data protection authority fined a maintenance company EUR 15,000 for recording sickness causes and leaving absence records online without authentication.",
     "grade": "E1",
     "source": "[S14]",
     "kind": "legal"
    },
    {
     "claim": "Clock-in tied to named cleaners can check attendance, so the works council must consent.",
     "grade": "E1",
     "source": "[S7]",
     "kind": "legal"
    }
   ],
   "assumptions": [
    "Boundary: from hours worked to payroll and budget view; pay calculation is outside.",
    "Input contract: published roster from the planning system; site budgets set by the operations manager; fallback is paper time sheets.",
    "Approving hours does not change.",
    "Payroll staff time is outside the supervisor's savings."
